WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A benchmark is not performance. Evaluate AI inside the domain and decision that matter.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Name the domain decision.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Lock model, version and conditions.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Test failures that matter here.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Include people and workflow consequences.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Bound exactly what the score proves.
